                        "review": "strategy game in which you manage an alien colony, controlling their daily lives and experimenting with Earth humans\n\n✅DNA fusion system allows you to fuse a human with an alien lifeform and select the clone's favorable traits (faster mining, higher turret fire rate, increased damage, etc.).\n✅Interesting mix of Tower Defense and RTS genres (base building, resource management, wave defense)\n✅Each planet offers new challenges, with waves of enemies increasing in difficulty and numbers, and special levels adding variety.\n✅Very good humor and dialogue (emails, NPC interactions, absurd situations).\n✅good soundtrack.\n✅The price is adequate for the game's content.\n\n❌The pixel art isn't appealing at all, but I appreciated other things that I liked\n❌No options menu during gameplay changing settings requires returning to the main menu\n❌Little enemy variety\n❌Weak employee management system\n\nDecent [/strike], [b] Good [/b], [strike] Very Good [/strike] (Rating scale for short games, retro indie simulator games, and similar)\n\n\n[quote] If you'd like to see more of my reviews, you can find them on my\ncurator page:\n[url=https://store.steampowered.com/curator/45994324/admin/reviews_manage/]CuratorKingViking[/url]\nand on my group:\n[url=https://steamcommunity.com/groups/CuratorKingViking]GroupKingViking[/url]\n\nIf you have any questions about my reviews, feel free to ask.\nI'm happy to answer them. All reviews are my own!!\nBest regards, King Viking Bezimienny, Polish Game Reviewer. [/quote]",
